# Security headers for static hosting (Netlify-compatible _headers file).
# This file lives in public/ so it is copied into dist/ on every build.
# For other hosts, map these headers manually (e.g. Cloudflare Pages _headers
# uses the same syntax; Vercel: vercel.json rewrites/headers).
#
# Note: frame-ancestors cannot be set via <meta> CSP — X-Frame-Options: DENY
# below provides equivalent clickjacking protection at the host level.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
